@startuml use_case_diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "TODO Manager" {

  package "Interactive mode" {
    usecase "Use interactive menu" as UI

    usecase "Add task" as I_ADD
    usecase "List / filter tasks" as I_LIST
    usecase "Show task details" as I_SHOW
    usecase "Change task status" as I_STATUS
    usecase "Update task" as I_UPDATE
    usecase "Delete task" as I_DELETE
    usecase "Quit application" as I_QUIT
  }

  package "Command-line mode" {
    usecase "Use one-shot CLI command" as CLI

    usecase "Add task" as C_ADD
    usecase "List / filter tasks" as C_LIST
    usecase "Show task details" as C_SHOW
    usecase "Start task" as C_START
    usecase "Complete task" as C_DONE
    usecase "Reopen task" as C_REOPEN
    usecase "Update task" as C_UPDATE
    usecase "Delete task" as C_DELETE
  }
}

User --> UI
User --> CLI

' Layout hints: hlavní use case vlevo, extensions vpravo
UI -[hidden]right-> I_ADD
UI -[hidden]right-> I_LIST
UI -[hidden]right-> I_SHOW
UI -[hidden]right-> I_STATUS
UI -[hidden]right-> I_UPDATE
UI -[hidden]right-> I_DELETE
UI -[hidden]right-> I_QUIT

CLI -[hidden]right-> C_ADD
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_LIST
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_SHOW
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_START
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_DONE
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_REOPEN
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_UPDATE
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_DELETE

' UMLově správně: extension use case ukazuje na base use case
I_ADD    ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_LIST   ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_SHOW   ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_STATUS ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_UPDATE ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_DELETE ..> UI : <<extend>>
I_QUIT   ..> UI : <<extend>>

C_ADD    ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_LIST   ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_SHOW   ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_START  ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_DONE   ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_REOPEN ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_UPDATE ..> CLI : <<extend>>
C_DELETE ..> CLI : <<extend>>

@enduml